      "content": "hey im in my garden and just stabbed my foot pretty deep with an old rusty trowel. its bleeding a bit but i think i can handle it. do i just need to wash it out with soap and some peroxide and put a bandage on it? i really dont want to go to the doctors if i dont have to",
